   <text:h text:style-name="P48" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc6583_3499536570"/>Oliver From Memory<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc6583_3499536570"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P61"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">Oh, Ollie,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">yeah, I...</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">I remember Ollie.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">Draw me a picture,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">draw not me,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">draw</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">my goat</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">of life.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">I remember him in full.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">I know him.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">I can point out his every feature, like his</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62"><text:s/>perfect teeth</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62"><text:s/>red hair</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62"><text:s/>rocking bod</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62"><text:s/>choice in athletic shoe</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P63"><text:s/>3mm gap between the first and second knuckle of his left hand.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P63"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P63">Yeah,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P63">I know that guy,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P63">and he</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P63">knows me</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P63">so well, I</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P63">promise.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P63"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P63">Really,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P63">truly:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P63">He knows me</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P63"><text:soft-page-break/>inside and</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P63">out,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P63">cuz&apos;</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P63">he&apos;s my</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P63">one and only</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P63">Olliebear.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P63"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P63">I know that man.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P48" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc8148_1175081228"/>Part Of Oliver From Memory<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc8148_1175081228"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">In the morning light</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">the water&apos;s warmed</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">ever so slightly</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">enough</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">to break off a chunk</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">and float it to the surface.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P64"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">Rising from the ocean</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">is an iceberg</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">breaking the waves and</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">ripping through the wind.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P65">Clothed under the ocean&apos;s flotsam,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P66"><text:span text:style-name="T38">just waiting there for someone to finally</text:span>—</text:p>
