   <text:p text:style-name="P68"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P68">In it&apos;s place, let these two pages and drawing be a grave<text:span text:style-name="T39">, a marker to what happened here</text:span>.<text:span text:style-name="T39"> Let it become a memory.</text:span></text:p>
