   <text:h text:style-name="P48" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc5646_1813330706"/>People Deadass Used To Send Letters Like This<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc5646_1813330706"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P72"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P73">DEAREST OLIVER</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P73"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P73">I DON&apos;T KNOW JUST WHEN YOU WILL GET THIS LETTER BUT SINCE IT IS THE NEW TYPE OF MAIL<text:span text:style-name="T40"> </text:span>I THOUGHT I WOULD LIKE TO TRY IT ANYWAY<text:span text:style-name="T41"> STOP </text:span>IT HAS BEEN <text:span text:style-name="T40">TWO MONTHS</text:span> OUT ON THE FRONT LINES WITHOUT YOU MY LOVE STOP I DO NOT THINK I WILL MAKE IT ANOTHER MOMENT WITHOUT YOU<text:span text:style-name="T42">R TOUCH</text:span> STOP</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P73"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P73">SO SORRY I HAVENT WRITTEN <text:span text:style-name="T42">SOONER</text:span>, BUT IT SEEMS LIKE THERE IS ALWAYS SOMETHING TO DO AND I TRY AS HARD AS I CAN TO KEEP BUSY<text:span text:style-name="T41"> STOP I HAVE BEEN SO LOST IN THOUGHT AS OF LATE S</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T40">TOP SOMETIMES I WONDER IF ALL THIS IS WORTH THE TIME I SPEND AWAY FROM YOU STOP I AM PREPARING A HOUSE FOR YOU AS I WRITE SO YOU CAN LOOK FORWARD TO SOMETHING IN THE FUTURE STOP</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P73"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P73">WHEN YOUR HEART HURTS AND CANNOT GO ON PLEASE FORGET ME SO THAT WE MAY ONCE AGAIN MEET FOR THE FIRST TIME AFTER ALL THIS IS OVER STOP HOWEVER NO MATTER WHAT I WILL NEVER FORGET EVEN A MOMENT OF OUR TIME STOP I WILL NOT STOP</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P73"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P73">LOVE</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P73">YOUR <text:span text:style-name="T42">YOUNG STREET SOLDIER</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P73"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P74"><text:soft-page-break/><text:span text:style-name="T43">P STOP S STOP </text:span>BY THE WAY HAVE YOU SEEN THE PRICE OF STAMPS LATELY STOP ACTUAL CRIME BRO I COULD NOT BELIEVE HOW MUCH THEY BE CHARGING AT WALMART FOR A STICKER STOP <text:span text:style-name="T43">THEY ONLY SELL THEM IN PACKS OF 20 MY GOD STOP </text:span>STILL PAYED IT FOR YOU BBGURL YOU KNOW I CARE <text:span text:style-name="T43">TYPE SHIT </text:span>STOP PLEASE SEND NUDES AT YOUR EARLIEST CONVENIENCE STOP</text:p>
