   <text:p text:style-name="P87">Genuinely man.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87"><text:s text:c="3"/>&quot;Jeez, it&apos;s colder than a well-digger&apos;s you-know-what out there.&quot;</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P59"><text:span text:style-name="T51"><text:s text:c="3"/>&quot;</text:span>Holy buckets, did you see the size of that walleye<text:span text:style-name="T51">?&quot;</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P59"><text:span text:style-name="T51"><text:s text:c="3"/>&quot;</text:span>Ope, lemme just squeeze past ya there<text:span text:style-name="T51">.&quot;</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">These are the phrases of my hearts deepest yearnings.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">Well,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">second only to</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">You</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">of course.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P48" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc4877_1189619379"/>You Complete Me<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc4877_1189619379"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">Two puzzle pieces,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">but they only</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">come together</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">one way.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">You ever see that?</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P78"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">You fit</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">right here<text:span text:style-name="T46">—</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">right in me,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">but take my piece,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">and it just doesn&apos;t</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">go in.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">I don&apos;t know</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">how to get</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">inside of you,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">but</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">I just wish</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">I could complete</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">You,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">as you</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">do me.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">In you, I&apos;<text:span text:style-name="T52">ll feel</text:span> right.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">But in me,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">how do You feel?</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">Does my insertion</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">fill a hole</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">you need?</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P89" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc7983_3237030879"/>My Notes App Poem Ideas From This Morning<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc7983_3237030879"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P90"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">The pause right before I answer back when</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">you say I love you.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">Two gay cowboys after one last job:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">&quot;heh, at least I got to share one last ride, pardner&quot;</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P90"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P67">I&apos;m not in the closet<text:span text:style-name="T46">—</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P67">I&apos;m under your bed.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P67"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">Ignore me:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">I&apos;m a beta chud cuck maxer.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">Of all the sins,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">lust<text:span text:style-name="T35">—</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">glorious lust<text:span text:style-name="T35">—</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">you arrive most.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">I&apos;m 14 and this is deep<text:span text:style-name="T35">—</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">well,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">I&apos;m actually 21,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">but still.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">Olliegey (like and elegy, but for Ollie).</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">Ollie&apos;s different nicknames:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">Kittenwhiskers,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">Olliebear,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">Mine.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P48" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc782_3676532460"/>:<text:span text:style-name="T53">3</text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc782_3676532460"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"/>
