   <text:h text:style-name="P48" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc5344_1427829761"/>Choose Your Own Poem<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc5344_1427829761"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P91"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P92">Oh <text:span text:style-name="T18">hey</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T54">yy </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T18">Ollie</text:span>,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P92">didn&apos;t see you there,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P92">you come here often?</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P93">Oh, you</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P93"><text:s text:c="2"/>you</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P93"><text:s text:c="5"/>you also live here?</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P93"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P93"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P93"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P92">It&apos;s been a while, huh,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P92">well,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P92">I&apos;m feelin pretty tired</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P92">so I&apos;m just gonna head on over to bed now<text:span text:style-name="T46">—</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P92">I&apos;m going up the stairs,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P92">ok byee<text:span text:style-name="T18">eeee</text:span>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P92"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P92">FUCK.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P92">goddammit.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P92">Why did I speak like that?</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P93"><text:s text:c="3"/><text:span text:style-name="T33">you come here often</text:span> come ON man, you live with him.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P92">I just can&apos;t talk to that dude man,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P92">it&apos;s alright,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P92"><text:s text:c="3"/>it&apos;s alright,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P92">LOCK IN.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P92">Now what?</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P94"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P95"><text:span text:style-name="T55">T</text:span>o <text:span text:style-name="T56">let out some stress and cook some sourdough, go to page</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T55"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T55"><text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="page" text:ref-name="cyop_stareatceiling">27</text:bookmark-ref></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T55">.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P96"><text:span text:style-name="T55">To </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T57">stare at the ceiling and think</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T55">, go to </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T56">the poem on page</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T55"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T55"><text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="page" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc6031_1427829761">62</text:bookmark-ref></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T56">.</text:span> </text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P96"><text:span text:style-name="T55">To</text:span> <text:span text:style-name="T57">go to bed and </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T56">crank to</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T57"> Oliver</text:span>, go to page <text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="page" text:ref-name="cyop_dreamofollie">30</text:bookmark-ref>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P97"><text:span text:style-name="T55">T</text:span>o skip this <text:span text:style-name="T55">shit </text:span>and go to the next poem, go to page <text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="page" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc4873_1189619379">32</text:bookmark-ref>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P98"><text:bookmark text:name="cyop_stareatceiling"/>Continued from page <text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="page" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc5344_1427829761">26</text:bookmark-ref>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P93"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P99">You&apos;re going to need 330g of warm water, 100g of <text:span text:style-name="T58">active sourdough starter, 10g of salt, and 450g of flour.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P100"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P100"><text:span text:style-name="T59">Now</text:span>, mix <text:span text:style-name="T59">it </text:span>all together in a large bowl and cover with a damp towel. Leave for an hour, then go into 4-6 stretch and folds over the next 8 hours (pretend there&apos;s four corners to the bowl and lift each corner up and over to the other side).<text:span text:style-name="T59"> If the dough&apos;s sticky, you did something wrong, search it up and watch videos of better, happier people making bread and smiling.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P100"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P100">Shape the dough into a <text:span text:style-name="T33">tight</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T18"> burrito lookin thing, </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T60">this is easier than </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T61">you think it is</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T60">, </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T18">and then put </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T60">the roll </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T18">in the fridge for some cold fermentation over night (seam-side up</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T60"> of course, just trust me</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T61">,</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T60"> it&apos;s important</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T18">).</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P101"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P101">Preheat <text:span text:style-name="T59">the </text:span>oven to 500<text:span text:style-name="T62">°</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T63">F, score the bread, lower </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T64">the </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T63">oven </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T64">down </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T63">to 450 degrees</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T64">, realize you don&apos;t own a dutch oven so you&apos;re actually ruined and all of this won&apos;t work out,</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T63"> and </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T64">finally </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T63">cook bread on a tray for about 40 minutes</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T64"> until smoky.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P102"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P102">Let rest an hour, eat it all in a moment of biblical greed, and go back to bed to think over what you&apos;ve done. Ignore Ollie on your way up the stairs, he can&apos;t see you like this.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P102"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P103">No one can.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P104"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P104"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P105"><text:span text:style-name="T55">To </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T57">stare at the ceiling and think</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T55">, go to </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T56">the poem on page</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T65"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T55"><text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="page" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc6031_1427829761">62</text:bookmark-ref></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T56">.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P105"><text:span text:style-name="T55">To</text:span> <text:span text:style-name="T57">go to bed and </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T66">crank to</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T57"> Oliver</text:span>, go to page <text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="page" text:ref-name="cyop_dreamofollie">30</text:bookmark-ref>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P106"><text:span text:style-name="T67">To </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T68">walk back down and try again</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T67">, go to page </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T67"><text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="page" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc5344_1427829761">26</text:bookmark-ref></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T67">.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P107"><text:bookmark text:name="cyop_dreamofollie2"/>Continued from page <text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="page" text:ref-name="cyop_dreamofollie">30</text:bookmark-ref><text:span text:style-name="T56">.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P108"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">What better after you <text:span text:style-name="T33">crank</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">than to lay back</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">and dream of that one</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">and only</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">glowing star on your</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">popcorn ceiling</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">with the green constellations</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">marking your parents touch</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">and the last hopes</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">before you left</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">and changed.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">Sleep</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">and meet</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">with Dream Ollie<text:span text:style-name="T9">,</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">and see everything you ever wished for</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">made realized,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">and see</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">that all these people</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">were children once,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">and that</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">you were too<text:span text:style-name="T46">—</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">you had dreams</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">like these</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">and didn&apos;t shy away<text:span text:style-name="T69">; </text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">you told any and every star</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">you had dreams,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">you</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">shared everything</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">because</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"><text:soft-page-break/>who would stop a child from dreaming</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">except</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">for your own self.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">In the dream,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"><text:s text:c="2"/>you are more than this flesh</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"><text:s text:c="2"/>you are free to make anything you want</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"><text:s text:c="2"/>you always say the right thing</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"><text:s text:c="2"/>you are always funny</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"><text:s text:c="2"/>you are always laughing</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"><text:s text:c="2"/>and</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"><text:s text:c="2"/><text:span text:style-name="T70"><text:s/></text:span>no one can hurt you.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"><text:s text:c="4"/>You can&apos;t lose anyone, and all your friends are still here.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"><text:s text:c="4"/>You</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"><text:s text:c="8"/>are still here.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"><text:s text:c="12"/>Keep dreaming and looking back</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"><text:s text:c="13"/>towards the people</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"><text:s text:c="14"/>and memories</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"><text:s text:c="15"/>that made you who you are.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"><text:s text:c="16"/>Dream Oliver</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"><text:s text:c="17"/>is waiting</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"><text:s text:c="17"/>and never</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"><text:s text:c="18"/>out of time.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"><text:line-break/> <text:s text:c="18"/>You</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"><text:s text:c="19"/>are never</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"><text:s text:c="20"/>alone</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"><text:s text:c="21"/>here.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P110"><text:span text:style-name="T55">To </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T71">dream EVEN MORE about Ollie</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T55">, go to page </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T55"><text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="page" text:ref-name="cyop_dreamofollie3 Copy 2">31</text:bookmark-ref></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T55">.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P111"><text:bookmark text:name="cyop_dreamofollie"/>Continued from page <text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="page" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc5344_1427829761">26</text:bookmark-ref>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P112"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">Oh yeah you dirty little piggie</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">you little <text:span text:style-name="T70">slopper</text:span> of a dreamer</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">come on then</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P113">piggie</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">here&apos;s some slop for the <text:span text:style-name="T69">mud rollers</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">some crank slop</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">so</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">go on then</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">crank</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P109">crank it to the <text:span text:style-name="T33">thought</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T18"> of Oliver Hendricks</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P114">crank until the <text:span text:style-name="T70">slop</text:span> dries up</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P114">crank until your wrists waste away</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P114">crank until</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P114">until</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P114">until you can&apos;t crank anymore</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P114">c&apos;mon</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P115">crank</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P116">crank</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P117">crank</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P112"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P112"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P112"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P112"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P112"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P112"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P112"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P112"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P118"><text:span text:style-name="T55">To</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T71"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T56">dream</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T71"> about Ollie</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T55">, go to page </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T55"><text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="page" text:ref-name="cyop_dreamofollie2">28</text:bookmark-ref></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T55">.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P119"><text:span text:style-name="T67">To </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T68">walk back down and try again</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T67">, go to page </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T67"><text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="page" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc5344_1427829761">26</text:bookmark-ref></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T67">.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P120"><text:bookmark text:name="cyop_dreamofollie3 Copy 2"/>Continued from page <text:span text:style-name="T65">25</text:span>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P121"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P122">And Dream Ollie</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P122"><text:s text:c="2"/>looked at you.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P122"><text:s text:c="2"/>knew you were never truly here.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P122"><text:s text:c="2"/>knew you carry yourself through imagination.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P122"><text:s text:c="2"/>said he loved you.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P122"><text:s text:c="2"/>said you can&apos;t love him.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P122"><text:s text:c="2"/>said the text you read is a dream.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P122"><text:s text:c="2"/>said creation and destruction come from the same heart.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P122"><text:s text:c="2"/>said you should talk more.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P122"><text:s text:c="2"/>said share your heart more or die.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P122"><text:s text:c="2"/>said he could not tell you how to love.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P122"><text:s text:c="2"/>said to tell you how to love is to prevent you from loving.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P122"><text:s text:c="2"/>said this is but a dream.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P122"><text:s text:c="2"/>said no dream is more than the long dream.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P122"><text:s text:c="2"/>said the long dream is life.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P122"><text:s text:c="2"/>said no dream is forever.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P122"><text:s text:c="2"/>said the past is not a dream you can go back to.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P122"><text:s text:c="2"/>said you are alive.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P122"><text:s text:c="2"/>said you are the air that fills your lungs.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P122"><text:s text:c="2"/>said you are someone else&apos;s long dream.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P122"><text:s text:c="2"/>said you are a voice.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P122"><text:s text:c="2"/>said you are the light.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P122"><text:s text:c="2"/>said not everyone has a light.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P122"><text:s text:c="2"/>said to move on.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P122"><text:s text:c="2"/>asked</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P122"><text:s text:c="15"/><text:span text:style-name="T56">in 40 years what will you tell your grandkids</text:span>:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P123"><text:s text:c="23"/><text:span text:style-name="T65"><text:s/></text:span><text:s text:c="4"/><text:span text:style-name="T65"><text:s/></text:span><text:s/>That you <text:span text:style-name="T65">only </text:span>dreamed?</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P124"><text:s text:c="2"/>said</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P124"><text:s text:c="6"/>it&apos;s time</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P124"><text:s text:c="12"/>to <text:span text:style-name="T69">wake</text:span> up.</text:p>
