   <text:p text:style-name="P154">because it is easier to laugh</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P154">than to cry;</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P154">Easier to be like others</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P154">than to be</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P154">human;</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P154">Easier empty and boring</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P154">than to</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P154">be.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P154"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P154">It is lonely</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P154">even among men,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P154">but easy<text:span text:style-name="T46">—</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P154">more efficient</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P154">than changing their hearts:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P154">Changing my own.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P154"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P154">So little energy is needed</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P154">to get by.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P154">A lifetime to escape</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P154">these feelings.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P154"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P155">Lighter</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P156">to<text:span text:style-name="T51"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T42">just</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P156">never.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P48" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2000_818021894"/>Never Have I Ever<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2000_818021894"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P49"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P49">Never have I ever</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P49">gotten fucked up at a party. OH YEAH!.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P49">Never have I ever</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P49">broken someone’s DUMBASS table at a RAGER!</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P157">Never have I ever</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P157">wanted to drink ‘till I PUKE!</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P157">Never have I ever</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P157">wanted a hangover. UH huh.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P49">Never have I ever</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P49">ignored a phone call. <text:span text:style-name="T86">cool</text:span>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P157">Never have I ever</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P157">stayed home to be alone.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P158">Never have I ever</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P158">made a mistake.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P49">Never have I ever</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P49">promised to change.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P49">Never have I ever</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P49"><text:span text:style-name="T86">hid</text:span> something <text:span text:style-name="T87">to fit in</text:span>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P49">Never have I ever</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P49">regretted a decision.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P157">Never have I ever</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P157"><text:s text:c="2"/>felt like I wanted to speak to you</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P157"><text:s text:c="2"/>been the good one all alone</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P157"><text:s text:c="2"/>told you everything you mean to me</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P159"><text:s text:c="2"/><text:span text:style-name="T87">dreamt</text:span> of a face I should <text:span text:style-name="T87">forget</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P157"><text:s text:c="2"/>meant everything I say—</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P157"><text:s text:c="2"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P49">Never have I ever</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P49"><text:span text:style-name="T87">missed</text:span> You <text:span text:style-name="T87">more</text:span>.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P48" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc820_3326894427"/>Soapstone<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc820_3326894427"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P160"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P160">My heart is one of those</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P160">smooth stones,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P160">hard to hold</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P160">and easy to drop—</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P160">to drop hard.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P160">It’ll slip right through</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P160">your shaking fingers as you</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P161">squeeze to the rhythm</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P161"><text:span text:style-name="T88">and keep me </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T89">up</text:span>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P160"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P160">My stone is like <text:span text:style-name="T89">soap</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P160">and won’t mix</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P160">with your <text:span text:style-name="T89">oil</text:span>,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P160">no matter how much</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P160">we hold on.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P160"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P160">I only make</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P160">myself clean</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">slipping through</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P163">your fingers.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P48" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc818_3326894427"/>Another Place, Another time<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc818_3326894427"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">Are you <text:span text:style-name="T90">waiting</text:span>,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">are you out there;</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">Pushing off the now</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">and thinking of...</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">Check back again</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">after I&apos;ve made it.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">When we meet, <text:s/>when I, <text:s text:c="3"/>when I,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">when I see you.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">There&apos;s tomorrow—</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">always tomorrow.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">Promise.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P48" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1319_3007704144"/>Maybe-Poem<text:span text:style-name="T91">s</text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1319_3007704144"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164">Not enough image,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P165">and too <text:span text:style-name="T91">direct to</text:span> be a poem.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164">I&apos;ve just written</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164">and thrown in</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164">some</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164">random</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164">line-breaks</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164">here and</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164">there;</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164">Maybe an expression</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164">of something on my mind,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164">but so far,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164">there&apos;s no meter or prose</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164">worth keeping on the page—</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P166">or in my heart.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164">But hey,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164"><text:span text:style-name="T76">a poet once</text:span> called them <text:span text:style-name="T9">their</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164"><text:s text:c="4"/><text:span text:style-name="T33">hot beer shits</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T18">,</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164">and I don&apos;t feel that way</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167">about anything here,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164">so I think I&apos;ll call them</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164"><text:s text:c="4"/>maybe-poems,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P168">from a</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P168"><text:s text:c="4"/>maybe-person,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164">or, maybe <text:s text:c="2"/>maybe</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164">maybe a poem,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164">a poem that</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164">may be,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164"><text:soft-page-break/>if only a</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164">person like me</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164">may be</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164">around</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164">someone like</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164">You.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P48" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1023_1230340041"/>Between My Ears I Cannot Sing<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1023_1230340041"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">As you walked away</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P169"><text:tab/><text:span text:style-name="T92">I</text:span>t was my heart that first beat out of my chest. Slapping onto the floor, it kept pulsing while my teeth fell out and my skin sloughed off and my bones jumped out the hole in my chest, and the organs and liquids without their cage poured from me an ungodly spray of everything else wet and human.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P170"><text:tab/>All around, an ensemble started to their sections. The large intestine and colon formed chairs as small hand bones made stands for hairy sheet music. Muscle fibers rewrapped around jaw bone to fret strings, while the lungs, teeth, and larynx became a choir, and the skull a drum. Blood boiled, then congealed with lips and spit to form the brasses.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P170"><text:tab/>At the very center, a heart pumped erect as the conductor. Holding a metatarsal, it started waving <text:span text:style-name="T92">the</text:span> baton as the orchestra reared and let out every innermost</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P170">desire.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P170"><text:tab/>Used to furtive glances, eyes now drowned in your sight burnt onto skin. Ears listened for the first time to ideas that were never given a second chance, having always been caught at the back of a throat, which now sang with teeth secrets never shared about everything extraordinary, beautiful, and you. Fingers flexed for a missed touch, all the while drumming on the one that hid it all.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P170"><text:tab/>Each part played their misuse, but I could not command them to stop. Just a single organ left, I tried to <text:soft-page-break/>convey every fault I ever had, every reason to avoid m<text:span text:style-name="T92">e</text:span>— but nothing came out as familiar hands raised the conductor, and I realized how perfect everything would be if only it was</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">without me.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P48" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1317_3007704144"/>Never Bad News<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1317_3007704144"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">I must have been born wrong.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">I think— <text:s text:c="2"/>I think—</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">I think there must be something</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">that separates me from everyone,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">that something went wrong</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">in my development,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">that something isn&apos;t normal in me.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P171">That somethin<text:span text:style-name="T93">g</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P171">makes me not like you.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">I want—</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">I want to be like you,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">I want to be normal,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">but something&apos;s wrong.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">I don&apos;t know what happened,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">but somewhere along the line,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">I got lost,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">and no one came back</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">to find me.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">No one ever</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">wants to bring</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">bad news.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P48" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1315_3007704144"/>As I Lay Here Beside You<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1315_3007704144"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">I can only stare at the back of your head,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">wondering</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">what I should do,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P172"><text:span text:style-name="T89">or</text:span> how I should talk to you</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P172">tomorrow.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">If I could but reach out</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">and touch you</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">as I can now laying here,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">I would show you this heart—</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">place your hand over my chest,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">this feeling made real.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">As I lay here beside you,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">I don&apos;t want to wake up</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">to an empty bed</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">and<text:span text:style-name="T9"> remember</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">yesterday&apos;s</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"><text:span text:style-name="T51">d</text:span>ream.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P48" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2551_4237564503"/>Swampman<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2551_4237564503"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">To be born is to be temporary.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">Sliding from one moment</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">to the next,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">we are made anew</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">in a pass—</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">only to look out</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">and seek</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">by our side</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">some fleeting</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">of another,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">carrying</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">this desire forward,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">as if we need</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">a reason,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">like some</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">swampman</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">of a thing.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">Do you remember what</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P174">you</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">told me last year?</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">Or, where</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">you</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">escaped from boredom in the summer?</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">Was—</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">Is that you?</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">Are you still here?</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">To who is it I speak</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">that bears your face?</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173"><text:soft-page-break/>The time we shared is gone,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">and the people with it—</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">So, this is my last poem.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">I die with these words.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">Whoever wrote this</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">will never be me,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">not again.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">And whoever reads this</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">will remember</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">as if they wrote it,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">but then</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">that is a lie.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">A good one.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">I&apos;m not me</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">around You—</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">Not anymore.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">I’ll chase</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">all the same,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">as it’s what I know</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">to have been.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">I was here.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">You are now.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">Forget—</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P173">once again.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P48" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc6031_1427829761"/>Falling Asleep Before The Party Ends<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc6031_1427829761"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P175">Continued from page <text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="page" text:ref-name="cyop_stareatceiling">27</text:bookmark-ref>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P176"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P99">Maybe this is what it&apos;s like to die;</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P99"><text:span text:style-name="T59">Ju</text:span>st lying here</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P99">and hearing everyone downstairs</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P177">mingle</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P177">as the music</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P177">wafts up</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P177">with the heat,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P177">but don&apos;t worry,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P177">a box fan&apos;s</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P177">drying my eyes</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P177">and throat out</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P177">while</text:p>
