   <text:p text:style-name="P180">I confess I used mouthwash after <text:span text:style-name="T35">we’d hang out</text:span>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P183">I confess I didn’t have to leave early for work in the morning.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P180">I confess I wanted you to break up with me, <text:span text:style-name="T94">so I </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T35">didn’t </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T94">change</text:span>.</text:p>
