   <text:p text:style-name="P180">I confess I <text:span text:style-name="T35">miss</text:span> you,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P180">that I loved you,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P180">and that I didn’t fight enough.</text:p>
