   <text:p text:style-name="P180">I confess I should have tried harder,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P180">that I didn’t know how to—</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P180">That I didn’t know how to feel.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P180">I confess that it’s my fault <text:span text:style-name="T94">how</text:span> I <text:span text:style-name="T35">end</text:span> up,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P180">and that I</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P180">threw it all away.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P183">I confess I was confused, but not <text:span text:style-name="T35">with You</text:span>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P183">I confess I didn’t know until it was too late.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P180"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P180">I confess I’m the problem.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P182">I confess I’<text:span text:style-name="T94">ll </text:span>never get to confess <text:span text:style-name="T35">everything</text:span>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P183">I confess time turns everything <text:span text:style-name="T38">to</text:span> regret<text:span text:style-name="T38"> and</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P184">I confess</text:p>
