   <text:p text:style-name="P188">I don&apos;t <text:span text:style-name="T51">want to </text:span>think of the past,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">these are not new mistakes, just old ones repeated,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">and I don&apos;t</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P188">miss You...</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P188"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P188">You know what, I&apos;m, yeah,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P188">I&apos;m happy,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P188">I&apos;m happy,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P188">I&apos;m happy. I&apos;ll say it again:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P189"/>
