   <text:p text:style-name="P62">because</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">I won&apos;t see you again</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">and maybe</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">I&apos;ll never know,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">but</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">it happened.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">I was here</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">and it happened.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">I happened.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P178">So if you still love me,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P178">forget me, and</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62"><text:span text:style-name="T42">w</text:span>e<text:span text:style-name="T35">—</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">This whole thing&apos;s a</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">poison</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62">I can&apos;t stop drinking.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P48" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc6573_3499536570"/>Oliver From Memory<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc6573_3499536570"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P191">oran<text:span text:style-name="T96">g <text:s text:c="14"/>mouth <text:s text:c="14"/>tongue <text:s text:c="14"/>hair <text:s text:c="14"/></text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P188"><text:s text:c="6"/>scream <text:s text:c="13"/>fight <text:s text:c="16"/>burn</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P188"><text:s text:c="3"/>run <text:s text:c="14"/>light <text:s text:c="14"/>overhead <text:s text:c="9"/>tickle</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P188"><text:s/>ol-o- o <text:s text:c="14"/>on <text:s text:c="9"/>heart <text:s text:c="16"/>toe</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P188"><text:s text:c="6"/>first-floor <text:s text:c="13"/>year <text:s text:c="15"/>stairs <text:s text:c="13"/>bread</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P188">running <text:s text:c="13"/>get out <text:s text:c="14"/>grass <text:s text:c="14"/>air <text:s text:c="13"/>sky</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P188"><text:s text:c="8"/>hand</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P188">hand</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P188"><text:s text:c="2"/>Hand</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P188"><text:s text:c="4"/><text:span text:style-name="T42">Hand with the</text:span>...</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P61"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P61">Who?</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P48" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc11935_1015851859"/>Your Spit Drying Off My Lip<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc11935_1015851859"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">I still smell you on my breath;</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">last nights promises</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">drying on my lip</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">in the morning.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">You could not love me in the light,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">but I could not love you in the dark,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">so where does the love go</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">when it&apos;s lost.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">When did I stop thinking</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">of You.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">Forgive me</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">for taking a heart</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">and trying to make it my own.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">Forgive me</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">for trying to cage a bird</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">and capture it&apos;s song.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">Forgive me</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">For stealing what was never mine,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">and for giving what was never yours.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">And forgive me</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87"><text:span text:style-name="T42">for always</text:span> getting so low</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">between an end</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">and a new beginning.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P192" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc6571_3499536570"/>Modern<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc6571_3499536570"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P193">I can see it before me:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P193"><text:span text:style-name="T97">t</text:span>he coffin closing,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P193">the nails hammered,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P193">the dirt overhead,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P193">and the burner,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P193">and the <text:span text:style-name="T97">tears</text:span>,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P193">and the <text:span text:style-name="T98">fall back</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P194">down a dark tunnel</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P194">as the light gets farther,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P195">and the fear,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P194">and <text:s text:c="2"/>and</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P193">and the <text:span text:style-name="T97">relief...</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P193"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P193">Is this all that’s left?</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P193">Up before the sun,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P193">enough time for dinner,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P193">living two days a week,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P193">and my memories of You—</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P193">Looking out the window</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P193"><text:span text:style-name="T97">at</text:span> a <text:span text:style-name="T31">grey</text:span> day,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P193">expressionless.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P193"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P193">And now I think:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P193">It was easier to hate</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P193">than to <text:span text:style-name="T97">be nothing.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P48" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1969_4086586558"/>Nothing Hurts<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1969_4086586558"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">When I wake up at night, I can’t move.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">I see it standing in the corner, like</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">it’s afraid of me: Mass of flesh</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">and a concave face, bent in</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">and hiding features.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">It drips in the</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">darkness.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">I</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">never</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">got to hate</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">you, because I</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">never got to know you.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">A chasm inside a torso and</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">where you should be— nothing.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">We are frozen as space shrinks.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">It’s forced closer, or I am. In</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">shadow without feature,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">it drips down into</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">cupped hands.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">Finger gaps</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">spill.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">Silent</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">car rides,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">and awkward</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">phone calls. Nothing said</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">over bad food or in company.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130"><text:soft-page-break/>Something hurts in between the</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">moments, but all I can remember are</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">eyes, blue and piercing. Pink with</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">tears; made only sharper still.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">They drip onto me, and</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">search my features.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">Frantically pore</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">over a face,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">lost.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">I don’t have your eyes.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">Hands reach outward</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">and ruffle hair, grope</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">face, and pull <text:span text:style-name="T99">a</text:span> nose.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">It cracks my jaw and</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">raises a chin, searching.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">Grip tighter the throat</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">as tears fall fatter;</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">No features alike.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">Beat on the chest</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">and caress downward,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">digging into stomach.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">Rip through muscle</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">and gorge on blood,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">while scanning through</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">a blur for something</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">that was never there.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">Pull out my entrails</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">like they belong to you,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">dragging past the abdomen,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">lower and lower with his</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130"><text:soft-page-break/>hands gaunt and bruised—</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">working hands—</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">reaching farther underneath</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">until <text:s/>unt i l <text:s text:c="2"/>u n t i l—</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">a blanket is pulled higher.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">Space returns, and we separate</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">from embarrassment. Look</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">as hands raise to cover</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">eyes, crying rivulets.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">We merge into</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">our shame,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">apart.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">Once</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">was here,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">but now you’re</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">gone. I can’t lose</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">what I never knew,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">so what do I miss? Forget </text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">it, as the twilight into the dusk.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">I’m awake. Light stabs through closed</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">blinds, and I can move freely.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">There’s paper in my hands,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">fingers white with grip.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">I can’t let go. What</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">haunts me.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P130">Nothing.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P48" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc9123_1015851859"/>Nothing Proves Your Alive<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc9123_1015851859"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">A hole at the center of my being</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">reflecting light</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">and catching</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">as a black hole</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">captures all trying to escape</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">probably gives it</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">a form</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">I could see;</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">I have seen,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">in the face of all science</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">an image,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">a hazy image,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">but a sight</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">of nothing</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">given shape.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">Black holes</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">can be seen</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">even without</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">a source of light</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">bouncing off it.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">You have probably seen</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">nothing</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">with eyes made for seeing</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">something.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">It&apos;s there</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">expanding ever outward</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">and pulling in more</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">all the same.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196"><text:soft-page-break/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">There&apos;s nothing</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">and then there&apos;s something,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">and me,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">and You,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">and everything else.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">Nothing expands outward</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">until</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">there is something.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">I am still growing.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">but</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">in this head</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">You</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">have frozen</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">forever.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">To me,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">You</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">are our last encounter;</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">forever stuck to that last moment</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">while we both</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">change</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">apart.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">This nothing</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">is more alive</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">than this</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P196">memory.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P48" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1025_1230340041"/>I’m Not Struggling<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1025_1230340041"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">All the media I<text:span text:style-name="T100">&apos;ve known</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">portrays love as a struggle</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">of wills against some force,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">of conflict and resolution—</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">a drama.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">The protagonists come together,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">and through their struggle</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">against some other force,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">learn to love each other,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">strengthen their bonds,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">and form resolute declarations</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">of understanding about the other<text:span text:style-name="T101">s</text:span>,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">as can only be learnt from</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">facing hell with someone.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162"><text:span text:style-name="T100">And </text:span>I <text:span text:style-name="T101">f</text:span>eel in myself a desire</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">for <text:span text:style-name="T101">your</text:span> time, <text:span text:style-name="T101">but</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">I don&apos;t think it&apos;s love,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P197">I don’t think it’d last, <text:span text:style-name="T89">and</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162"><text:span text:style-name="T89">maybe</text:span> that&apos;s the culture in me,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">based off what I consume.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">I&apos;ve broken my ability to love wholly,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">because I&apos;m incapable of loving</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">when times are good.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">I love when it&apos;s bad.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">I don&apos;t have many issues,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">and I&apos;m afraid to be</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162"><text:soft-page-break/>incapable of love.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">Am I lonely,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">or forcing myself to...</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">What do I like.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P162">I&apos;m disgusting.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P164"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P198"><text:span text:style-name="T89">But</text:span> I thin<text:span text:style-name="T89">k</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P198"><text:span text:style-name="T89">I</text:span>’m happy.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P53" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc6575_3499536570"/>Unlike Anyone Else<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc6575_3499536570"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">Put your hand here,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">and tell me what you feel:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">A beat,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">hard against my chest—</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">You feel it?</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">Remind you of anyone?</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">If any evidence I needed</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">of my own existence,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">I&apos;m alive and I&apos;m</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">human,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">but</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">sometimes</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">I don&apos;t know</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">if</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"><text:s text:c="4"/>if</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">if I feel right.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">If I&apos;m...</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">If I&apos;m supposed to feel like</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"><text:s text:c="3"/><text:span text:style-name="T33">this</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T102"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">like if I&apos;m just a little off,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">or</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">if this is just how I feel,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">that this is how I am</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">and to be me,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">and no one else,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">is something beautiful.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"><text:soft-page-break/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">I&apos;ve been told that a long time,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">and I really do want <text:span text:style-name="T42">it</text:span> to be true—</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">really, more than anything—</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">but I just can&apos;t shake this feeling</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">that I&apos;m missing out on something.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">That there&apos;s a part of this whole</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">experience</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">I&apos;ve got wrong, that I can try to</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">fill</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">but&apos;ll end up pouring one glass</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">after another</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">down this bottomless</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">hole of</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">of</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"><text:span text:style-name="T100">..</text:span>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">I have a heart,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">but I can&apos;t use it—</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">It&apos;s a gift to be me,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">and unlike anyone else.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">Unlike anyone.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P199" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc780_3676532460"/>Be Normal<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc780_3676532460"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P200"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P200">I don’t want to be normal,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P200">I want to be me.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P200"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P200">Isn’t that enough?</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P48" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1998_818021894"/>So What If I’m Not Normal<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1998_818021894"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167">Fuck being normal:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167">I’ve never met a normal person</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167">my whole life.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167">From day one it’s been</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167"><text:span text:style-name="T103">weird shit</text:span> that define<text:span text:style-name="T104">d</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167">my every <text:span text:style-name="T104">remembered</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167">experience with others.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167">No one I’ve ever come across</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167"><text:span text:style-name="T104">had</text:span> a <text:span text:style-name="T104">boring</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T103"> </text:span>life;</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167">everyone’s hiding something ‘till</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167">they can share a little more of themselves,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167">‘<text:span text:style-name="T104">till their bursting at the seams of</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P201">wanting to connect over</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167">hobbies,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167"><text:span text:style-name="T103">little interests</text:span>, or</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167"><text:span text:style-name="T103">secrets</text:span>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167"><text:span text:style-name="T104">I</text:span>f I had to be</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167">more like someone else,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167">there’d be no point to the whole</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167">of my life <text:span text:style-name="T105">being lived</text:span>. <text:span text:style-name="T103">So</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167">I like me,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167">even if—</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167"><text:span text:style-name="T104">if</text:span>—</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P167"><text:span text:style-name="T104">i</text:span>f You <text:span text:style-name="T106">didn’t</text:span>.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P48" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc9121_1015851859"/>Flower of a Warrior<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc9121_1015851859"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">Flower of a warrior;</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">your time is past,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">but you keep on</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">wilting</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">as the water flows</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">and the earth grows.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">Flower of a warrior;</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">you are past your bloom.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">Your time has come</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">as it has for any</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">that experience the spring.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">Flower of a warrior;</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">your petals fall</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">and your stem drops</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">as the color leaves your days.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">Flower of a warrior;</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">Only painted flowers</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">never die.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">You have lived<text:span text:style-name="T35">—</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">be content</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">in that.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P48" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc11931_1015851859"/>How Could I Forget<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc11931_1015851859"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">My every failure</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">only pushes me deeper</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">down the trampoline,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">so how</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">could I forget</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">that if</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">I&apos;ve gotta go,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">then I&apos;m gonna love</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">every second.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P202">It will suck.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P202">I will smile.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P202"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P202">Forget the prose,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P202">the meter,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P202">the meaning.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P202">Did you feel something.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P202"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P202">That&apos;s what I want You to remember.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">Just not</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">me.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P203" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc19033_1983556278"/>No Advice Worth Giving<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc19033_1983556278"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">Be wrong.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">Try writing.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">Get a buzzcut.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">Drive to Colorado.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">Get lost on a hike.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">Only do leg days.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145"><text:span text:style-name="T42">Read</text:span> just on Tuesdays.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">Talk during the movie.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">Tell people you eat porridge.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">Learn how to bake sourdough.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">Use nothing from your degree.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">Talk louder than the room.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">Claim climbing is your hobby.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">Sleep only on couches for vacation.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">Overdue the same bit till it&apos;s unfunny.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">Swiss cheese they ahh.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">Sleep on the floor and refuse a frame.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">Dream of a mountain <text:span text:style-name="T42">you&apos;ll never cross</text:span>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">Wear the same shoes for three years.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">Stare <text:span text:style-name="T42">in the eyes of </text:span>people you walk<text:span text:style-name="T42"> by</text:span>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">Learn to paint and forget it the next day;</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">Forget everything and start again, and again, and again, and again</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">Smile more.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">But just</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">don&apos;t fall in love.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P146"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">And hey,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">stop calling me</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P145">a hypocrite.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P48" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc4875_1189619379"/>Give Up<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc4875_1189619379"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">Everything you&apos;ve ever done</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">Everyone you&apos;ve ever loved</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">Everybody you&apos;ve ever met</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77"><text:s text:c="3"/><text:span text:style-name="T107">Every run</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77"><text:s text:c="3"/>Every meal</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77"><text:s text:c="3"/>Every conversation</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">It doesn&apos;t matter.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">You&apos;re going to die</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">and it doesn&apos;t matter.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P78"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">If it doesn&apos;t flow from you</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">for something,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">or someone,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">then what&apos;s the point.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">If you&apos;re not on the floor</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">staring at the ceiling</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">thinking nothing</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">and slipping forward<text:span text:style-name="T46">—</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P78"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">You need to give up.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P78"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">You&apos;re not you,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">not by floating at least,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">and that&apos;s ok,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">despite what they tell you.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P78"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">But you really should,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">take it from me, a stranger:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">Give up,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">and try.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P48" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc776_3676532460"/>Goodbye Ollie,<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc776_3676532460"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P204"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P59"><text:span text:style-name="T51">So, here we are: The end of the road</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T35">—</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T51"> The donkeys ass. If I&apos;ve learnt anything through this, I&apos;m not good enough to express myself through language, as I&apos;m sure you figured out past the first half. I can&apos;t use my words to make something beautiful. I can&apos;t use my words to make myself beautiful.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">Maybe I’m not all that afraid of being unable to express myself, but that there’s nothing to express. I’m afraid of being nothing, that I have no dramatic knots in my living cords.<text:span text:style-name="T51"> But, at least for a time, you alleviated that feeling, and let me think I had something to say that others might find interesting. You let me believe I had a story, one I could share. One worth listening to.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">So<text:span text:style-name="T82">... </text:span>thank you Ollie. And goodbye. For what it&apos;s worth, I enjoyed every line, and I hope you did too.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P59"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87">Now forget me and go forward, as the moment to the hour, as the day to the year. Too much complexity just isn&apos;t our style.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">Sincerely,</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Poetry_20_Text">Vova</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P205" text:outline-level="1"/>
   <text:h text:style-name="P18" text:outline-level="1"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1996_818021894"/>Acknowledgments<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1996_818021894"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P206"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P206">My thanks to Jakob Hammond and Tyler Bond for putting up with me over the summer I worked on this, and for always offering good ideas towards improving what I had.<text:span text:style-name="T108"> Special thank you to Jake for his agreeing to help voice the audio book on YouTube with me. </text:span>This wouldn’t have <text:span text:style-name="T109">been</text:span> nearly <text:span text:style-name="T109">as</text:span> funny <text:span text:style-name="T109">a process</text:span> without your guy’s help, so thank you <text:span text:style-name="T109">for everything</text:span>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P206"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P207">Thank you to Caleb Neville for reading this collection while I drafted <text:span text:style-name="T108">it</text:span>. <text:span text:style-name="T108"><text:s/></text:span>Thank you for always believing in me<text:span text:style-name="T56">, even if you gave no feedback: </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T108">The hardest part of any project is sharing it with another person.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P206"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P208">And of course, a special thanks to the subject of all this poetry, the individual that all my writing was focused towards (and no one else), Oliver Hendricks. Thanks for allowing this to go down<text:span text:style-name="T108"> and still laughing as I came by with crude concepts to write about</text:span>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P206"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P206">The following literary pieces were used as formatting <text:span text:style-name="T108">and style </text:span>reference<text:span text:style-name="T108">s</text:span> <text:span text:style-name="T110">(front-matter, end-matter, all-matter...)</text:span> through<text:span text:style-name="T109">out</text:span> the making of this book<text:span text:style-name="T109">. I hope my </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T89">reference</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T109"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T89">to</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T109"> their</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T89">s</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T109"> does no disservice to these great pieces of art </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T89">and their artists</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T82">/editors</text:span>:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P209"><text:tab/><text:span text:style-name="T111">American Primitive</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T112">, </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T109">Mary Oliver</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P210"><text:span text:style-name="T33"><text:tab/>Essential Bukowski: Poetry</text:span>, Abel Debritto</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P211"><text:tab/><text:span text:style-name="T113">Madness, Rack, and Honey</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T89">, Mary Ruefle</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P212"><text:tab/><text:span text:style-name="T111">milk and honey</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T112">, </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T114">R</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T109">upi </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T89">K</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T109">aur</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P212"><text:tab/><text:span text:style-name="T113">Of Tyrant</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T89">, Leah Umansky</text:span></text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P18" text:outline-level="1"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1994_818021894"/>About the Author<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1994_818021894"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P213"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P213">Vladimir <text:span text:style-name="T47">&quot;V</text:span>ova<text:span text:style-name="T47">&quot;</text:span> Tomasovitch <draw:frame draw:style-name="fr12" draw:name="Image1" text:anchor-type="char" svg:x="2.5402in" svg:y="-0.0161in" svg:width="1.75in" svg:height="2.1902in" draw:z-index="2"><draw:image xlink:href="images/abouttheauthor-BusinessSelfBW.jpg" xlink:type="simple" xlink:show="embed" xlink:actuate="onLoad" draw:mime-type="image/jpeg"/>
    </draw:frame>Herdman <text:span text:style-name="T52">grew up in</text:span> Northeast Ohio. At the time of publishing, he <text:span text:style-name="T115">is 21 years old and </text:span>has know<text:span text:style-name="T116">n</text:span> Oliver Hendricks for 3 years. <text:span text:style-name="T117">He may never write again, </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T110">and apologizes for all you had to endure to reach this point</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T117">. </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T118">The next book will be formatted using LaTeX.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P213"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P213">If you’ve gotten this far, you know enough about me.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P18" text:outline-level="1"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1992_818021894"/>About the Muse<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1992_818021894"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P213"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P214">Where do I even start… Oliver <draw:frame draw:style-name="fr12" draw:name="Image2" text:anchor-type="char" svg:x="2.602in" svg:y="-0.0118in" svg:width="1.75in" svg:height="1.9799in" draw:z-index="3"><draw:image xlink:href="images/aboutthemuse-OllieBW.jpg" xlink:type="simple" xlink:show="embed" xlink:actuate="onLoad" draw:mime-type="image/jpeg"/>
    </draw:frame>Hendricks was born in the year 2004 to<text:span text:style-name="T52"> parents Jenny and Ollie-Dad. He grew up in New York along a river, later going on to live in Southwest Ohio, a move that only put him closer to me and my </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T108"><text:s/>sphere of </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T52">influence. Around the time of elementary school, Oliver realized he wasn&apos;t like the other kids: He was stronger, faster, smarter, and </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T108">had </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T52">an overall greater, </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T108">fattier</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T52"> liver than anyone around him. He had so much grey matter in his already giant (for a child&apos;s) head, that doctors thought he had a tumor growing in his skull. After the surgery, they realized their mistake, but he was never quite the same after that</text:span>…</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P214"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P135"><text:span text:style-name="T108">While writing some of the poems for this piece, I reached out to Ollie with some questions. Mostly, I sought an interview with him so I could better enter the mindset of who I was writing about, and who, sometimes, I was responding as. During the interview, I made a small, offhand comment about the greatest day of Oliver&apos;s life. It was meant to be a joke, but instantly, and without much warning, he grabbed my by the shoulders and leaned in close. His eyes glazed over</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T119"> and rolled back into his head</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T108">, his face got red, and he started speaking like he was reading some ancient text in a hoarse whisper. I now recite, verbatim, the unedited words he told me</text:span>:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P215"><text:span text:style-name="T120"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P216"><text:soft-page-break/><text:span text:style-name="T120">&quot;The greatest day of my life? Oh, yeah, yeah, I gotcha, that was the day I met Vladimir &apos;Vova&apos; Tomasovitch Herdman, acclaimed author and close personal friend, you know, that one guy with the ginormous penis. You know, they say it&apos;s so big, he has to wrap it around himself like it&apos;s a belt</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T121">, that he once used it like a grappling hook</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T120">. Man, that guy really knows how to make me laugh. I be straight gigglin whenever he&apos;s around, kickin my feet and shi</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T121">ii like a &apos;lil schoolgirl</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T120">. Is this a safe space? If I&apos;m being honest here, I&apos;d suck that guy dry for a nickel, and that&apos;d be ME paying HIM for the privilege. I Really miss Vova, I haven&apos;t seen him ever since the incident. You know, they be callin him dime dick now, but not cause they&apos;re payin for it...&quot;</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P214"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P217"><text:span text:style-name="T52">Ahem... As the above text shows irrefutably, Oliver Hendricks loves me, and would do anything to please me and make my day</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T108"> a little sunnier. But to be honest, just his presence alone brightens my world. And this is definitely, 100%, without a shadow of a doubt</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T78">—</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T108"> the exact words he spoke to me, unprompted.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P217"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P218">Beyond that, Oliver later decided to attend College at...</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P214"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P214"><text:span text:style-name="T117">Oh, just no more, please. I’ve </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T89">let out</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T117"> enough on him. I thought it’d be funny to make this and say it’s after him, </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T89">so that’s how this all started</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T117">.</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T108"> It&apos;s a joke of mine, so I hope it made someone laugh.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P213"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P214">If you’ve gotten this far, you <text:span text:style-name="T122">should</text:span> know even less about him<text:span text:style-name="T78">—</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T52"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T117">Keep it that way, he’s mine.</text:span></text:p>
  </office:text>
 </office:body>
</office:document>